OL,3,GNEWSASuspected unexploded ordnance
OL,4,Afound in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 150m (492ft) cordon has been set up
OL,7,Fafter suspected unexploded ordnance was
OL,8,Ffound in a dock.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said
OL,11,Femergency services were called out
OL,12,Fafter the object was found in Falmouth
OL,13,FDocks at 09:15 BST.
OL,15,FThe force said the cordon, which covers
OL,16,Fland and sea, has been put in place
OL,17,Fwhile an investigation is carried out
OL,18,Fand two homes have been evacuated.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
