OL,3,GNEWSASuspected unexploded ordnance
OL,4,Afound in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist explosive ordnance disposal
OL,7,Fofficers have been contacted and
OL,8,Fmembers of the public and boat users
OL,9,Fhave been asked to avoid the area,
OL,10,Fpolice added.
